### Pricing exception service: happy path (default profile, H2 + seed data).
### Run the app with ./mvnw spring-boot:run. Works in IntelliJ / VS Code REST Client.
@host = http://localhost:8080
@rm = rm-erik
@reviewer = rev-sara

### 1. RM creates a request for an OPEN application without an active request (MA-1003)
# @name create
POST {{host}}/api/pricing-exceptions
X-User-Id: {{rm}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicationId": "MA-1003",
  "discountBps": 40,
  "reason": "Long-standing customer, competing offer from another bank"
}

> {% client.global.set("id", response.body.id); client.global.set("etag", response.headers.valueOf("ETag")); %}

### 2. Read it back: PENDING, one SUBMITTED event, ETag "0"
GET {{host}}/api/pricing-exceptions/{{id}}
X-User-Id: {{rm}}

### 3. Reviewer approves with If-Match = the ETag (decidedBy comes from X-User-Id, never from the body)
# @name approve
POST {{host}}/api/pricing-exceptions/{{id}}/decision
X-User-Id: {{reviewer}}
If-Match: {{etag}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outcome": "APPROVED",
  "comment": "Within my limit"
}

> {% client.global.set("etag", response.headers.valueOf("ETag")); %}

### 4. Read it back: APPROVED, two events, approvedDiscountBps = 40, ETag "1"
GET {{host}}/api/pricing-exceptions/{{id}}
X-User-Id: {{reviewer}}

### 5. List all PENDING requests (seed has one on MA-1002)
GET {{host}}/api/pricing-exceptions?status=PENDING
X-User-Id: {{rm}}

### 6. Error examples
### 6a. Missing X-User-Id -> 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
GET {{host}}/api/pricing-exceptions/{{id}}

### 6b. Second decision on an APPROVED request -> 409 INVALID_TRANSITION
POST {{host}}/api/pricing-exceptions/{{id}}/decision
X-User-Id: rev-johan
If-Match: {{etag}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "outcome": "DECLINED" }

### 6c. Withdraw the seed PENDING request without If-Match -> 428 IF_MATCH_REQUIRED
POST {{host}}/api/pricing-exceptions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/withdrawal
X-User-Id: rm-anna

### 6d. Withdraw it with a stale If-Match -> 412 VERSION_MISMATCH
POST {{host}}/api/pricing-exceptions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/withdrawal
X-User-Id: rm-anna
If-Match: "99"
